      "id": 63054,
      "name": "Belteshazzar",
      "username": "Belteshazzar",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e274bd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-14T15:20:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just get the cheap penny sleeves from Amazon (Ultra Pro). They can't sit horizontally in the box any more, but setting them vertical just makes the top of the box rest a little higher when it's closed. I'm not sure if this is the case with premium sleeves, but with the penny sleeves, the EE box doesn't hold all the cards, so picking up a cheap cardboard card collector's box is worthwhile. (I know people have some freaking awesome card carrying solutions, but my friends and I are holding off until all the expansions are out and can figure out a more elegant&nbsp;solution from there.)</p>",
