      "created_at": "2013-05-14T17:32:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Depending on the version of the Enhanced edition the Mayday Green sleeves may either stick out on the top or fit perfectly. I have found they also seem a bit tight on the Rook City cards.</p><p>Otherwise they work well for Shattered Timelines and Infernal Relic.</p>",
