      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jagarciao/{size}/2010_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-14T18:12:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, it is worth noting that different editions vary in size a bit. I have two different printings of enhanced edition which have different lengths by a couple of mm. Also, Rook City cards seem to be a little wider than all others.&nbsp;</p><p>That's why I just use the FFG premiums, they are a little big but they are sturdy and fit everything.&nbsp;</p>",
